summary:
  Only the directory's resolved address is auditioned, never the station's own.

history:
  A byuuid row holds two addresses: where the checker last ended up, and
  the door the station handed in. They differ on one row in nine, and a
  station added from the search saves the resolved one — so when that dies
  the front door is all there is, and it was never tried.

target:
  package/contents/ui/HealLogic.js

find:
      if (firstOnly !== true) doors.push((row.url || "").toString());

replace:
      if (firstOnly === true) doors.push((row.url || "").toString());

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_heallogic.qml::test_the_stations_own_front_door_is_tried_too.
  Line-neutral.
